    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d628">

                <pb facs="0607" n="1341" xml:id="pg1341"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-11-16"><hi rendition="#italic">November 16,
                        1895</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>To cooperate with the six Powers in any necessary measures to stop the general
                    massacre. Have avoided and will avoid all conferences regarding such measures
                    until you distinctly instruct otherwise. Russia has only one gunboat on southern
                    coast of the Black Sea, now at Trebizond. Russian ambassador says others will be
                    sent if massacres renewed on the coast of the Black Sea.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
